//! CAS ↔ chain composition module — GENERATED by `ggen sync run` from the
//! `strata-cas-pack` ontology (https://strata.chatman.ai/ontology#).
//! Do not edit by hand.
//!
//! COMPOSITION LAW (derived, 2026-10-13): the chain pack's shared-head KAT
//! folds four witnessed (pn, ocel) entries with h_0 = 32 zero bytes and
//! h_{i+1} = BLAKE3(h_i || pn_be || ocel_be || tick_be64), tick = top byte
//! of the ocel word widened to u64 big-endian, to the pinned 32-byte head
//! 05ea1aa0... . A fold chain with a 32-byte zero genesis and per-step
//! 32-byte digests is structurally a CAS commit chain (MerkleCommit::
//! genesis + child_of, depth = entry count), so this module admits the
//! chain KAT head as a CAS commit-chain witness under the shared 32-byte
//! chained-digest discipline. Gate: gates/030_cas_chain_composition.rq
//! (fail-closed). The chain pack's graph is not imported: the head and
//! entries are mirrored by literal from strata-chain-pack witness.ttl —
//! the same literals chain verify.py recompute-pins.
